flowchart LR
  R[Passenger reader] --> RM[lock mutex; increment count]
  RM --> F{first reader?}
  F -->|yes| W[lock writer semaphore]
  F -->|no| CP[copy seq, positions, seq]
  W --> CP --> DM[decrement under mutex]
  DM --> L{last reader?}
  L -->|yes| UW[unlock writer semaphore]
  C[Controller writer] --> EW[lock writer semaphore]
  EW --> UP[seq_a++; positions; seq_b=seq_a]
  UP --> EU[unlock writer semaphore]
